WEBVTT

00:05:59.660 --> 00:06:01.666
or when you switched to a new team,

00:06:01.690 --> 00:06:04.216
or when you ate a sad desk lunch alone

00:06:04.240 --> 00:06:06.053
for the 48th day in a row.

00:06:07.060 --> 00:06:09.796
We're making fewer friends
on the job than we used to.

00:06:09.820 --> 00:06:13.606
In 1985, half of people said
they had a close friend at work.

00:06:13.630 --> 00:06:16.606
By 2004, less than a third did.

00:06:16.630 --> 00:06:19.356
This is not the case everywhere, though.

00:06:19.380 --> 00:06:21.789
In India, research shows
that people go on vacation

00:06:21.813 --> 00:06:24.176
with nearly half
of their closest colleagues.

00:06:24.200 --> 00:06:27.775
In the US, it's pretty rare for us
to invite our coworkers over for dinner,

00:06:27.799 --> 00:06:29.319
much less take trips with them.

00:06:29.942 --> 00:06:32.126
There are many possible reasons for this.